  "releaseNotes": "ProcessConfiguration init-only construction, required TargetFilePath, ArgumentList replacing ArgumentsList\nProcessConfigurationFactory removed\nWorking-directory validation moved to construction\nNew Spec types: ArgumentsSpec, EnvironmentVariablesSpec, UserCredentialSpec, ProcessResourcePolicySpec\nIProcessConfigurationBuilder ConfigureXxx signatures changed to Action<XxxSpec>\nIExternalProcess and ExternalProcess constructors reduced, Configuration init-only\nProcessInvoker constructors reduced to two\nProcessResult: new Canceled, Signal, ExecutedFilePath properties; symmetric equality; null-safe equality operators\nBufferedProcessResult: WasTruncated immutable, included in equality, ProcessId in equality\nProcessExitConfiguration for exit-code and signal validation\nIProcessResultValidator, CommonValidationRules, ValidationRule\nProcessValidationException type\nMiddlewareChain, InvocationContext (renamed from ProcessInvocationContext), MiddlewareItems\nIRetryClassifier\nUserCredential.GetHashCode excludes Password\nIDisposable dropped from ProcessConfiguration\n.NET Standard 2.0, .NET 8, .NET 9 support dropped; net10.0 only, C# 14",
